window.__T={"A": "evenly spaced in one row with generous empty white space between them", "B": "each drawing a consecutive phase of one marching step (contact", "C": "evenly spaced in one row with generous empty white space"};window.__E="Hand-painted 2D cut-out animation art, children's history picture book style: clean dark-brown ink outlines, flat gouache colors with soft painted shading and visible paper grain, warm earthy palette (ochre, terracotta, sand, sage green, deep teal river, dusk violet), southwestern Mexico, Caxcan people of the Juchipila canyon in the year 1540. ";window.__C=[" No text, no letters, no watermark."];window.__I=[[0, "Wide panoramic establishing background of the Juchipila river canyon on a golden morning: a wide pale sandy riverbed with a shallow teal river winding through sand banks, big riverside ahuehuete trees, small terraced corn fields on the lower slopes, tall reddish canyon mountains with layered ridges fading into blue haze, big sky with soft painted clouds. Strong depth: foreground sand ripples and rocks, midground river and trees, background mountains. Open empty sandy ground across the lower third. No people, no animals."], [0, "Wide background of a Caxcan village on a river terrace in the Juchipila canyon, year 1540: small adobe and stone houses with thatched palm roofs, a low stepped stone platform with a small shrine on top, a milpa of corn with beans and squash, clay pots and a grinding stone by a doorway, thin smoke rising from cooking fires, the teal river and sand banks behind, reddish mountains in the distance. Strong depth with foreground plants. Open empty packed-earth ground across the lower third. No people, no animals."], [0, "Wide background of the same canyon valley under a cold grey-blue overcast sky: a rough Spanish encomienda house of adobe with a red clay tile roof and a heavy wooden door, a tall wooden cross beside it, a wooden fence corral, a pile of maize sacks and baskets stacked as tribute under a shed, a dirt path in the foreground, Caxcan hills and reddish mountains behind. Strong depth. Open empty dirt ground across the lower third. No people, no animals."], [0, "Wide background of the same canyon valley at night: deep violet-blue sky with stars and a pale moon, many bonfires burning on the tops of the hills and ridges with warm orange glow and smoke, the Spanish adobe house with red tile roof in the midground lit by a single torch, dark sand path in the foreground with long blue shadows. Dramatic but readable. Open empty ground across the lower third. No people, no animals."], [0, "Wide background at a blood-red dusk: a huge steep flat-topped rocky mountain fortress rising above the Juchipila canyon, its cliffs catching the last red light, thin smoke columns rising from its summit, dark layered ridges in the foreground and a winding river far below. Ominous and epic. No people, no animals."], [0, "Character model sheet on a plain flat pure white background: Petacatl, a Caxcan lord of about forty, brown skin, long black hair tied with a red cord, a headdress of a few long green and red feathers, white cotton cape with an ochre geometric border knotted at the shoulder, loincloth, leather sandals, jade bead necklace, holding a tall wooden staff. The SAME man drawn 5 times, full body, @A@, never touching or overlapping: front view standing calm; three-quarter view speaking with an open hand; pointing forward with arm fully extended; raising the staff high in anger; arms crossed, proud. No ground, no cast shadows."], [0, "Animation sprite sheet on a plain flat pure white background: walk cycle of Petacatl, a Caxcan lord with long black hair tied with a red cord, green and red feathers, white cotton cape with ochre geometric border, loincloth, sandals, wooden staff. The SAME character drawn 8 times in a single horizontal row, strict side view facing right, full body, same size and same height, evenly spaced and not touching, each drawing a consecutive phase of one walking step (contact, down, passing, up, for each leg). No ground, no cast shadows."], [0, "Character sheet on a plain flat pure white background: 6 different Caxcan villagers of the Juchipila canyon in 1540, full body, @C@, never touching or overlapping: an old farmer with a wooden digging stick; a woman carrying a clay water pot on her head; a small child holding a corn cob; a young warrior with a bow and a quiver of arrows; a warrior with an obsidian-edged wooden club and a round feathered shield; an elder woman grinding corn on a stone. Simple white cotton clothes with ochre and red details. No ground, no cast shadows."], [0, "Animation sprite sheet on a plain flat pure white background: run cycle of a young Caxcan warrior with long black hair, red headband, white loincloth, bow in one hand and a quiver of arrows on his back. The SAME character drawn 8 times in a single horizontal row, strict side view facing right, full body, same size, evenly spaced and not touching, each drawing a consecutive phase of one running stride. No ground, no cast shadows."], [0, "Character model sheet on a plain flat pure white background: Diego Hernandez de Proano, a Spanish encomendero of 1540, stern man with a dark pointed beard, steel morion helmet, polished steel breastplate over a dark red doublet, puffed breeches, high leather boots, sword at the hip. The SAME man drawn 5 times, full body, @C@, never touching or overlapping: standing with hands on hips; pointing and commanding; holding up an unrolled document with a red wax seal; stepping back frightened with hands raised; riding a brown horse, side view. No ground, no cast shadows."], [0, "Animation sprite sheet on a plain flat pure white background: gallop cycle of a brown Spanish horse ridden by a Spanish conquistador with a steel morion helmet, breastplate and red doublet, leaning forward in fear. The SAME horse and rider drawn 6 times in a single horizontal row, strict side view facing right, same size, evenly spaced and not touching, each drawing a consecutive phase of one gallop stride. No ground, no cast shadows."], [0, "Prop sheet on a plain flat pure white background, about 16 separate objects evenly spaced in a grid with generous empty white space, never touching or overlapping: yellow corn cob, blue corn cob, bundle of corn stalks, orange squash, clay bowl of beans, large clay water pot, woven basket of corn, tied burlap sack of tribute, wooden bow, three arrows, obsidian-edged wooden club, round shield with feathers, Spanish steel sword, rolled parchment document with red wax seal, burning torch, small bonfire. No ground, no cast shadows."], [0, "Scenery element sheet on a plain flat pure white background, separate cut-out pieces evenly spaced with generous empty white space, never touching or overlapping: a big ahuehuete tree, a small mesquite tree, a prickly pear nopal cactus, an agave plant, a cluster of tall grass, two rounded boulders, a flat rock, a strip of rippled sand dune, two painted clouds, and a row of 6 drawings of the same black bird showing a wing-flap cycle. No ground, no cast shadows."], [0, "Wide background of the Caxcan mountain fortresses (penoles) of the Juchipila canyon in 1541 under a harsh bright noon sky: a steep flat-topped rocky mountain with near-vertical cliffs, low dry-stone walls and wooden palisades along its rim, piles of round throwing stones, a narrow zigzag path climbing the cliff, thin war smoke rising from the summit, a second peñol behind in blue haze. Strong depth: foreground dry grass, agave and boulders, midground the rocky slope and the zigzag path, background the fortress summit and far ridges. Open empty ground across the lower third. No people, no animals."], [0, "Wide background of the Spanish viceroy's army camp at the foot of a steep rocky peñol in the Juchipila canyon, late 1541, warm afternoon light: rows of canvas tents, plain red and gold banners on poles with no symbols, two small bronze cannons on wooden carriages, stacked lances and shields, campfires with smoke, a supply cart, many cooking fires of the indigenous allies spreading far away across the valley. Strong depth: foreground trampled dirt, a fallen lance and rocks, midground tents and cannons, background the peñol and its cliffs. Open empty ground across the lower third. No people, no animals."], [0, "Character model sheet on a plain flat pure white background: Pedro de Alvarado, Spanish conquistador of 1541, tall man of about fifty-five with a red-golden beard and fair skin, steel morion helmet with a red plume, polished full steel breastplate over a crimson doublet, steel arm guards, high boots, a sword. The SAME man drawn 5 times, full body, @A@, never touching or overlapping: standing proud with the sword raised high; pointing up a mountain commanding his men; climbing a rocky slope on foot, leaning forward; lying fallen on his back in pain, helmet off; riding a big grey horse, side view. No ground, no cast shadows."], [0, "Character model sheet on a plain flat pure white background: Antonio de Mendoza, first viceroy of New Spain in 1541, a dignified Spanish nobleman of about fifty with a short grey beard and a white ruff collar, black velvet cap, black and gold doublet with a steel breastplate over it, a long dark cape, gold chain, sword. The SAME man drawn 5 times, full body, @A@, never touching or overlapping: standing calm with a hand on the sword hilt; pointing forward giving an order; studying an unrolled map held in both hands; raising a gloved hand to stop; riding a black horse with a red saddle cloth, side view. No ground, no cast shadows."], [0, "Animation sprite sheet on a plain flat pure white background: marching walk cycle of a Spanish foot soldier of 1541 with a steel morion helmet, steel breastplate, ochre sleeves, puffed breeches and a long pike held upright on his shoulder. The SAME soldier drawn 8 times in a single horizontal row, strict side view facing right, full body, same size and same height, evenly spaced and not touching, @B@, down, passing, up, for each leg). No ground, no cast shadows."], [0, "Animation sprite sheet on a plain flat pure white background: marching walk cycle of an indigenous Tlaxcalan ally warrior of 1541 in quilted white cotton armor, a red and white feather headdress, a round shield on one arm and a wooden club edged with obsidian. The SAME warrior drawn 8 times in a single horizontal row, strict side view facing right, full body, same size and same height, evenly spaced and not touching, @B@, down, passing, up, for each leg). No ground, no cast shadows."], [0, "Character model sheet on a plain flat pure white background: Tenamaxtli, Caxcan war leader of 1541, strong man of about thirty-five, brown skin, long black hair with a band of eagle feathers, red and black face paint, white cotton armor vest with ochre border, loincloth, sandals, a bow and a round feathered shield. The SAME man drawn 5 times, full body, @A@, never touching or overlapping: standing on guard holding the shield; shouting with the fist raised; drawing the bow aiming upward; throwing a big round stone with both hands; crouching behind the shield. No ground, no cast shadows."], [0, "Wide background of the Spanish refounding of Jalpa after the war, 1542, soft overcast morning: a small adobe and stone chapel under construction with wooden scaffolding and ladders, piles of adobe bricks drying in rows, a lime pit, a big wooden cross, a bronze bell hanging from a wooden frame on the ground, burned Caxcan houses in the distance, the sandy river and reddish canyon mountains behind. Strong depth: foreground adobe bricks and tools, midground the chapel and scaffolding, background the river and mountains. Open empty ground across the lower third. No people, no animals."], [0, "Same art style, but this picture is set in the 1600s: the colonial town of Santiago de Xalpa. Wide background of a small colonial town square at golden afternoon: a stone church with a single bell tower dedicated to Saint James, a low arcaded portal of adobe houses with red tile roofs, a stone fountain, cobblestones, ahuehuete trees, the reddish canyon mountains behind. Strong depth: foreground cobblestones and a nopal, midground the fountain and the portal, background the church and mountains. Open empty ground across the lower third. No people, no animals."], [0, "Character sheet on a plain flat pure white background: 6 different people of a new colonial town in the Juchipila canyon around 1550-1600, full body, @C@, never touching or overlapping: a Franciscan friar in a brown habit with a rope belt holding a small cross; a Caxcan builder carrying an adobe brick on his shoulder; a Spanish settler in a hat and doublet holding a hoe; a mestizo mother with a rebozo holding a baby; a Caxcan woman with a basket of maize; a boy ringing a small hand bell. No ground, no cast shadows."], [0, "Same art style, but this picture is set in about 1800: the silver mine La Leonera of Jalpa Mineral. Wide background on a bright morning: a mine entrance framed with heavy timber cut into a rocky reddish hillside, a wooden horse-driven winch (malacate) with a big drum and ropes, mine carts and piles of grey ore rock, a two-storey adobe company store (tienda de raya) with a wooden balcony on the upper floor and arched doorways below, a mule track winding down into the canyon. Strong depth: foreground ore rocks and a broken cart wheel, midground the winch and the company store with its balcony, background the mine hillside and canyon. Open empty ground across the lower third. No people, no animals."], [0, "Same art style, but this picture is set in January 1811: the same silver mine La Leonera at dusk. Wide background at a violet-orange winter dusk: the two-storey adobe company store (tienda de raya) of the mine seen from the front, its wooden balcony on the upper floor lit by two torches, an arched arcade below called the burnt portal with smoke-darkened stone, the timber mine entrance and the wooden winch on the hillside behind, first stars in the sky, a few campfires on the ground. Strong depth: foreground a dirt yard with ore rocks, midground the company store with its balcony, background the mine hill and stars. Open empty ground across the lower third. No people, no animals."], [0, "Same art style, but this picture is set in about 1800: Mexican silver miners. Character sheet on a plain flat pure white background: 6 different people of the mine, full body, @C@, never touching or overlapping: a miner with a straw hat swinging an iron pick; a miner carrying a big leather sack of ore on his back; a mine foreman in a black hat and jacket holding a ledger; a woman selling tortillas from a basket; a muleteer with a whip and a sombrero; a boy holding an oil lantern. Simple white cotton clothes, sarapes, leather sandals. No ground, no cast shadows."], [0, "Animation sprite sheet on a plain flat pure white background: walk cycle of a brown pack mule loaded with two leather sacks of silver ore tied on a wooden pack saddle. The SAME mule drawn 8 times in a single horizontal row, strict side view facing right, full body, same size and same height, evenly spaced and not touching, each drawing a consecutive phase of one walking stride. No ground, no cast shadows."], [0, "Same art style, but this picture is set in January 1811: the old royal road through the Juchipila canyon. Wide background at a dusty orange late afternoon: a dirt road winding through the canyon between mesquites, nopales and agaves, a stone milestone and a wooden cross by the road, the sandy river below, tall reddish canyon walls catching the last light, long shadows. Strong depth: foreground the dirt road with ruts and stones, midground mesquites and the river, background the canyon walls and sky. Open empty ground across the lower third. No people, no animals."], [0, "Same art style, but this picture is set in 1811: Father Miguel Hidalgo y Costilla, leader of Mexican independence. Character model sheet on a plain flat pure white background: Miguel Hidalgo, an old priest of fifty-seven, bald on top with long white hair on the sides, thick white eyebrows, wearing a long black cassock under a dark blue coat with a sash, black hat in hand. The SAME man drawn 5 times, full body, @A@, never touching or overlapping: standing tired, looking down; speaking passionately with one arm raised high (to be placed on a balcony); pointing north; walking with a wooden walking stick; riding a dark brown horse, side view, head bowed. No ground, no cast shadows."], [0, "Animation sprite sheet on a plain flat pure white background: tired walk cycle of a Mexican insurgent peasant of 1811 with a wide straw sombrero, white cotton clothes, a striped sarape on the shoulder and a machete in his hand. The SAME man drawn 8 times in a single horizontal row, strict side view facing right, full body, same size and same height, evenly spaced and not touching, each drawing a consecutive phase of one tired walking step. No ground, no cast shadows."], [0, "Same art style, but this picture is set in 1811: the retreating insurgent army of Hidalgo. Character sheet on a plain flat pure white background: 6 different insurgents, full body, @C@, never touching or overlapping: a man holding a banner pole with a plain blue and white cloth; a wounded man with a bandaged head leaning on a stick; a woman soldadera carrying a bundle; a rider on a skinny horse with a lance; a peasant with a sling; a drummer boy with a small drum. Ragged white cotton clothes, sombreros, sarapes. No ground, no cast shadows."], [0, "Same art style, but this picture is set in 1858 in Germany: a mineralogist's study. Wide background of a cozy 19th century mineralogy study at night lit by an oil lamp: a big wooden desk with a brass microscope, a magnifying glass, a small scale, rows of mineral specimens in glass cabinets, shelves of leather books, a window with snowy rooftops of a German town, a framed map of Mexico on the wall with no text. Strong depth: foreground desk with specimens, midground cabinets, background window. Open empty floor across the lower third. No people, no animals."], [0, "Same art style, but this picture is set in 1864, during the French intervention: the main square of Jalpa. Wide background under a cold grey sky: the stone church with two unequal bell towers (the left one massive, the right one slimmer) facing a plaza, arcaded portals of adobe houses with red tile roofs, closed wooden shutters, a stone fountain, a French tricolor flag of blue, white and red on a pole, a cannon on the cobblestones. Strong depth: foreground cobblestones and a fallen basket, midground the fountain and cannon, background the church and portals. Open empty ground across the lower third. No people, no animals."], [0, "Animation sprite sheet on a plain flat pure white background: marching walk cycle of a French infantry soldier of 1864 with a red kepi, dark blue coat, red trousers, white gaiters and a long rifle with bayonet on his shoulder. The SAME soldier drawn 8 times in a single horizontal row, strict side view facing right, full body, same size and same height, evenly spaced and not touching, @B@, down, passing, up, for each leg). No ground, no cast shadows."], [0, "Same art style, but this picture is set in the 19th century: several characters. Character sheet on a plain flat pure white background: 6 different people, full body, @C@, never touching or overlapping: an old German mineralogist of 1858 with white sideburns, spectacles and a black frock coat, holding a magnifying glass up to a dark rock; the same mineralogist writing in a notebook; a French officer of 1864 with a red kepi, blue coat and sword pointing forward; a Mexican townswoman with a dark rebozo looking worried; a Mexican townsman in a sombrero with arms crossed; a little girl hiding behind a barrel. No ground, no cast shadows."], [0, "Prop sheet on a plain flat pure white background, about 16 separate objects evenly spaced in a grid with generous empty white space, never touching or overlapping: a dark grey metallic crystal cluster of the mineral jalpaite on a rock, a shining silver bar, an iron pick, an oil lantern, a leather ore sack, a mine cart, a brass magnifying glass, a bronze church bell, a wooden cross, a small bronze cannon, a French red kepi, a rifle with bayonet, a plate of pink guava paste rolls, a basket of yellow guavas, a blue agave plant, a carved wooden tastoan dance mask with a long nose. No ground, no cast shadows."], [0, "Same art style, but this picture is set in today: the town of Jalpa, Zacatecas. Wide background of the church of the Señor de Jalpa at a clear late afternoon: a baroque church of warm ochre quarry stone with two unequal bell towers, the left tower massive with two bell openings, the right tower slimmer with a round clock and a bell, a carved facade with a star-shaped window, a stone atrium cross, round trimmed trees in front, cobblestone streets climbing a hill, colorful houses, electric street lamps, papel picado garlands. Strong depth: foreground cobblestones and a bench, midground trimmed trees and the atrium, background the church towers and sky. Open empty ground across the lower third. No people, no animals."], [0, "Same art style, but this picture is set in today, on the feast of Saint James in July: a village street of Jalpa municipality during the tastoanes dance. Wide background of a dusty village street in festival: rows of colorful papel picado across the street, a small whitewashed chapel with a bell, adobe houses painted blue, pink and yellow, food stalls with awnings, green hills of agave behind, a bright summer sky with big clouds. Strong depth: foreground confetti and dust, midground the open dance ground and stalls, background the chapel and hills. Open empty ground across the lower third. No people, no animals."], [0, "Same art style, but this picture is set in today: the Juchipila canyon at Jalpa. Wide panoramic background at golden sunset: the same wide sandy riverbed with a shallow teal river, but now the slopes are covered with neat rows of blue agave fields, a paved two-lane highway winding along the canyon with a small road sign with no text, the town of Jalpa with its two church towers far away, tall reddish canyon mountains fading into violet haze. Strong depth: foreground sand ripples and an agave, midground the river and agave fields, background the town, highway and mountains. Open empty ground across the lower third. No people, no animals."], [0, "Animation sprite sheet on a plain flat pure white background: dance cycle of a tastoan dancer of Jalpa: carved wooden mask with a long nose and beard, a tall crest of long cow hair, a bright red and yellow cape with ribbons, a wooden sword in one hand. The SAME dancer drawn 8 times in a single horizontal row, strict side view facing right, full body, same size and same height, evenly spaced and not touching, each drawing a consecutive phase of one jumping, stomping dance step. No ground, no cast shadows."], [0, "Same art style, but this picture is set in today: people of Jalpa, Zacatecas. Character sheet on a plain flat pure white background: 6 different people of the town today, full body, @C@, never touching or overlapping: a grandmother selling guava sweets from a tray; a man in a cowboy hat and boots; a teenage girl with a phone; a boy on a bicycle; a pilgrim woman holding a lit candle; Saint James (Santiago) of the tastoanes dance on a white horse with a red cape and a sword. No ground, no cast shadows."]];window.__P=(i)=>{const [c,t]=window.__I[i];return window.__E+t.replace(/@([A-Za-z])@/g,(m,x)=>window.__T[x])+window.__C[c]};window.__ins=async(i)=>{await new Promise(r=>setTimeout(r,3500));const ed=document.querySelector('.ProseMirror');ed.focus();document.execCommand('selectAll');document.execCommand('delete');document.execCommand('insertText',false,window.__P(i));return ed.innerText.length};window.__seen=new Set([...document.querySelectorAll('img')].filter(i=>i.src.includes('flow-content')).map(i=>i.src.split('?')[0]));window.__col=async(n)=>{const t0=Date.now();let o=[];while(Date.now()-t0<55000){o=[...document.querySelectorAll('img')].filter(i=>i.src.includes('flow-content')).map(i=>i.src).filter(u=>!window.__seen.has(u.split('?')[0]));if(o.length>=n)break;await new Promise(r=>setTimeout(r,2000));}o.reverse();o.forEach(u=>window.__seen.add(u.split('?')[0]));return o.map(u=>{const m=u.match(/image\/([0-9a-f-]+)\?Expires=(\d+)&KeyName=[^&]+&Signature=(.+)$/);return m?m[1]+' '+m[2]+' '+m[3]:u}).join('\n')};